    "semantic_summary": "ConsoleChatReader is a presentation utility responsible for rendering structured chat history from a JSON file directly to the console. It parses message objects, distinguishing between User and Assistant roles to apply specific visual formatting. It utilizes ConsoleTokenFormatter to handle token-level formatting, particularly for code blocks, and interacts with filesystem I/O and standard output streams."
